# Redirect old paths to /tags (canonical)
#
# The topic-hub rules MUST sit above the /resources/* splat. Rules are matched
# in file order, so with the splat first `/resources/topic/x` becomes
# `/tags/topic/x` — a URL that no longer exists and only bounces again
# client-side. Two hops and a soft redirect where one 301 belongs.
/tags/topic/*  /tags  301
/resources/topic/*  /tags  301
/ressources  /tags  301
/ressources/*  /tags/:splat  301
/resources  /tags  301
/resources/*  /tags/:splat  301

